{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_20","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"outcome\":\"ready-for-verification\",\"planSummary\":\"Completed the SV-02-001 follow-up by surfacing artifact-version producing-process provenance in the review UI, keeping the server response assertions explicit on version summaries, and re-running the story and epic gates successfully.\",\"changedFiles\":[{\"path\":\"convex/artifacts.ts\",\"reason\":\"Removed artifact-row process ownership from checkpoint persistence so revising an existing project artifact keeps one stable artifact identity and writes a new version row instead.\"},{\"path\":\"apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts\",\"reason\":\"Aligned the in-memory platform store with Story 2 by deriving artifact summaries from latest version history and avoiding ownership-style rewrites during checkpoint persistence.\"},{\"path\":\"apps/platform/server/services/review/artifact-review.service.ts\",\"reason\":\"Preserved producing-process display provenance when artifact review content loading degrades into an error state.\"},{\"path\":\"apps/platform/client/features/review/artifact-review-panel.ts\",\"reason\":\"Made the selected artifact version visibly show producing-process provenance in the review panel.\"},{\"path\":\"apps/platform/client/features/review/version-switcher.ts\",\"reason\":\"Made each artifact version option visibly show producing-process provenance in the version list.\"},{\"path\":\"convex/artifacts.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Added durable-state coverage for multi-process revisions keeping one artifact identity while recording separate version provenance.\"},{\"path\":\"tests/service/server/project-shell-bootstrap-api.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Added server coverage proving project-shell artifact summaries resolve currentVersionLabel and updatedAt from the latest durable version.\"},{\"path\":\"tests/service/server/artifact-review-api.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Strengthened artifact review API assertions so version summaries returned to the browser include producing-process provenance.\"},{\"path\":\"tests/service/client/artifact-review-panel.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Added UI assertions proving selected-version provenance is visible in the artifact review panel, including degraded states.\"},{\"path\":\"tests/service/client/version-switcher.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Added UI assertions proving version-summary provenance is visible in the artifact version switcher.\"}],\"tests\":{\"added\":[],\"modified\":[\"convex/artifacts.test.ts\",\"tests/service/server/project-shell-bootstrap-api.test.ts\",\"tests/service/server/artifact-review-api.test.ts\",\"tests/service/client/artifact-review-panel.test.ts\",\"tests/service/client/version-switcher.test.ts\"],\"removed\":[],\"totalAfterStory\":558,\"deltaFromPriorBaseline\":2},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm exec vitest run tests/service/client/artifact-review-panel.test.ts tests/service/client/version-switcher.test.ts tests/service/server/artifact-review-api.test.ts --environment jsdom\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"pass\"}],\"selfReview\":{\"findingsFixed\":[\"Surfaced producing-process provenance directly in the artifact review UI so the selected version now visibly shows both producedByProcessDisplayLabel and producedByProcessId.\",\"Surfaced producing-process provenance in the version switcher so earlier and current version summaries visibly identify which process produced each revision.\",\"Added explicit server-response assertions that artifact review version summaries returned to the browser carry producedByProcessId and producedByProcessDisplayLabel.\",\"Reconfirmed the full story after the UI fix with passing green-verify and verify-all runs.\"],\"findingsSurfaced\":[\"InMemoryPlatformStore still carries a synthetic artifact-version fallback for seeded test data that lack explicit version rows; that is a test-store compatibility shim, not the Convex production path changed by this story.\",\"ArtifactSummary’s TypeScript shape still tolerates legacy optional ownership fields for fixture compatibility even though the runtime schema/output strip them; broader cleanup of those compatibility fields is adjacent follow-up work, not required to satisfy Story 2.\"]},\"openQuestions\":[],\"specDeviations\":[],\"recommendedNextStep\":\"Return this story to verification and have the verifier rerun AC-2.2 / TC-2.2a / TC-2.2b against the artifact review UI and version-switcher provenance display.\"}"}}
